* Class A 30 W power amp (same drawing as preamp.net): 12AX7 long-tailed phase inverter (V8), four EL84
* as two parallel pairs on a shared 47 ohm / 220u cathode bias, no negative feedback, the output
* transformer, and the HT chain. B+ (node a, HT1) is the rectifier / reservoir, integrated by the engine.
*
* Assumptions where the drawing is silent or ambiguous (change them here, not in code):
*  - output transformer: 4k plate-to-plate onto the 8 ohm load, 6 H per primary half, 45 ohm per half,
*    coupling like the other amps;
*  - screens: 100 ohm each from HT2 (680 ohm + 33u from B+);
*  - Cut: 4n7 + 220k rheostat between the two grid lines; the knob turns the resistance down;
*  - HT3 (node x, 250 V) is 10k + 33u from HT2 and feeds the phase inverter plates and the preamp;
*    RPREAMP stands for what the preamp draws from it.

.nodes pin gr gl nt kv pa pb ga gb g1 g2 cn a h2 x pt pbm npt npb s1 s2 kc t8

S VAUDIO pin 50k 0
S VHT a 15 350

* Phase inverter V8: signal on the right grid through 100n, the left grid grounded by 100n; both grids
* returned through 100k to the tail junction (47k to ground), 1k2 between the cathodes and that junction.
C CIN pin gr 100n
C CGL gl 0 100n
R RGR gr nt 100k
R RGL gl nt 100k
R R1K2 kv nt 1k2
R R47K nt 0 47k
T V8A gl pa kv 12AX7
T V8B gr pb kv 12AX7
R R_PA x pa 100k
R R_PB x pb 100k

* Coupling to the EL84 grids (100n, 220k leaks to ground, 1k5 stoppers, two tubes per side) and Cut.
C C_A pa ga 100n
C C_B pb gb 100n
R RGA ga 0 220k
R RGB gb 0 220k
R RS_A ga g1 1k5/2
R RS_B gb g2 1k5/2
C C4N7 ga cn 4n7
R VR_CUT cn gb 220k

* EL84: V9 + V10 on the red half, V11 + V12 on the yellow half; common cathode 47 ohm || 220u.
P V9 g1 pt s1 kc EL84 2
P V11 g2 pbm s2 kc EL84 2
R RK kc 0 47
C CK kc 0 220u
R RS1 h2 s1 100/2
R RS2 h2 s2 100/2

* Output transformer: primary halves around the HT1 centre tap, one 8 ohm secondary.
R DCR_PT pt npt 45
R DCR_PB pbm npb 45
.param n8 = 2*1/sqrt(4000/8)
.xfmr OT L=6
  W npt a 1 pri
  W a npb 1 pri
  W t8 0 n8 sec
  K pri pri 0.9998
  K pri sec 0.9993
.end
R RLOAD t8 0 8

* HT chain: HT2 (680 ohm + 33u, screens), HT3 (10k + 33u, node x).
R R680 a h2 680
C C_H2 h2 0 33u
R R10K2 h2 x 10k
C C_H3 x 0 33u
R RPREAMP x 0 35k
